    aiSuiteCreditsTitle: 'How we dey pay for generation',
    aiSuiteDesc: 'DeHub dey bundle full set of AI tools for creators, all of dem dey inside di app and you no need external accounts or API keys. Di suite get conversational assistant, autonomous agents and no-code app builder, so you fit move from idea reach generated content or mini-app wey dey work without leaving di platform.',
    aiSuiteLink: 'Read di full AI Toolkits documentation',
    allowanceBadgeNote: 'Badge dey move both sides at once — bigger free allowance and lower price for anytin wey pass am. Di discount na di same ladder wey badge holders dey already get wen dem dey buy DeHub tokens, from 5% for Crab reach 30% for Megalodon, so na one answer dey for how much badge worth. Your allowance dey come from di badge wey you earn: tier wey patron borrow you go show for your profile, but e no dey give you dem posting allowance.',
