    appsB2Desc: 'For Google Play, or as direct APK download from dehub.io/apk for Android 8 and above.',
    appsDesc: 'DeHub dey run anywhere. Di web app for dehub.io na di full product inside browser, and e fit install for your home screen like native app for both desktop and phone. Di Android app dey for Google Play, and di latest build dey always available as direct APK from dehub.io/apk for anybody wey no wan pass through di store. Feeds, stages, posting, messaging, wallet and notifications all dey work di same way for both, and your account, badge and balance dey follow you from one to di oda.',
    appsTitle: 'Download di App',
    arcadeDesc: 'Di Arcade na shelf of games wey dey run inside DeHub for browser tab. Nothing to install, nothing to buy, no separate account: open one and play. Six titles dey available today — King\'s Gambit, cinematic 3D chess game wit online Elo ladder; Claude of Duty, shooter wey dey generate every mesh, texture and sound for your machine as di level dey load; Jungle Trail, first-person waka through rainforest wey dem generate procedurally; Street Slayer, side-scrolling beat \'em up wey dem build for DeHub; Chartopia, trading floor wey you fit waka inside, wit live market feeds for di desk monitors and VR mode through WebXR; and God\'s Eye, live 3D globe where you fit choose to put approximate version of yourself among di DeHub community. Developers fit submit dem own games for review.',
    arcadeDesc2: 'Two of dem dey also hide inside di appearance themes: set di app to War and you fit reach Claude of Duty from di theme itself, and di Jungle theme dey hide Jungle Trail. King\'s Gambit and Street Slayer get leaderboards, and every game get im own share card so link to any of dem go unfurl well anywhere wey you post am.',
