    articlesDesc: 'Long-form writing get im own mode. Switch di composer from Post to Article and you go get title, body of up to 20,000 characters, formatting toolbar, cover image and preview of how e go read. Article dey publish like any oda post, so pipo fit tip am, quote am, gate am and share am, and e go get im own share card wen dem post di link for anoda place.',
