    badgeDelegationB2: 'Slots dey come from your own stake:',
    badgeDelegationB2Desc: 'Badge wey you borrow no get im own slots, so tier wey dem lend you, you no fit lend am to anoda person.',
    badgeDelegationB3: 'Everybody fit see di patron:',
    badgeDelegationB4: 'You fit reverse am any time:',
    badgeDelegationB5: 'Na status, no be entitlement:',
    badgeDelegationB5Desc: 'Badge wey dem lend you na wetin di platform dey show, and e dey carry di weight wey dey wit dat tier — view or reaction from am dey count for di tier wey dem lend. Wetin e no dey carry na anytin wey get money price: your fee tier, your token purchase discount, your daily posting allowance and your own delegation slots, all of dem still dey come from di stake wey you hold by yourself.',
    badgeDelegationB6: 'Lend any rung wey you don climb:',
    badgeDelegationB7: 'Di oda side get mouth for di matter:',
    badgeDelegationDesc: 'You fit lend badge. Every rung wey you don climb dey give you one delegation slot — one for Crab, thirteen for Megalodon — and each slot dey give anoda account your own tier for as long as you leave am there. E dey because influence for DeHub suppose waka wit group, no be to sit for one wallet: crews, teams and second accounts dey get di tier wey dem backer hold, without anybody moving tokens or handing over keys.',
    badgeDelegationTitle: 'Borrow Person Your Badge',
    badgePriceDesc: 'Di thirteen tiers, from Crab reach Megalodon, each one get fixed price for dollars, no be fixed number of tokens. Di number of DeHub tokens wey tier dey ask for na dat dollar cost for di live price, so badge mean di same commitment no matter wetin di market dey do. Two protections dey come wit am: di requirement no go ever pass di published numbers if price fall, and once you don reach tier you go keep am — di badge wey you earn dey locked to di cheapest requirement wey dem ever earn am for, so price dip no fit collect am back from you.',
    badgePriceTitle: 'Di ladder price dey for dollars',
    badgeSubtitle: 'Di Badge of Honour Model',
    badgeTitle: 'Show Your Badge Make Dem See',
    badgeUnlock1: 'Lower fee for tips, pay-per-views, subscriptions and bounties, e dey drop 0.69% for each tier.',
    badgeUnlock2: 'Bigger free daily posting allowance, and discount for anytin wey pass am.',
    badgeUnlock3: 'Di same discount wen you dey buy DeHub tokens, from 5% for Crab reach 30% for Megalodon.',
    badgeUnlock4: 'Superpowers, profile cosmetics, more profile slots, more images for each post, and your own emoji, sticker and GIF packs.',
    badgeUnlock5: 'More weight for wetin you dey do: view or reaction from badge holder dey count pass, for di same ladder wey governance voting dey use — one if you no get badge, two for Crab, and one more rung for every tier wey dey above am reach fourteen for Megalodon. Na multiplier for your one reaction, e no be second reaction.',
    benefitsTitle: 'Benefit for Everybody Wey Dey Involved',
    bettingTitle: 'To Bet on Di Stars of Tomorrow',
    boostPowerDesc: 'Put post from last week for di top of di home feed. E dey unlock for Crab. E don dey live now.',
    cinemaDesc: 'Cinema for dehub.io/cinema na where-to-watch search for films and series. Search title and see every legal way to watch am for your country — which services dey stream am, how much rental cost and how much e cost to own am. Every film and series get im own page wit share card, and di community fit review am there.',
    commCreator2: 'Control who fit access your messages and how much e go cost',
