    step1Title: 'Download Di App',
    step1Desc: "Download DeHub d'App for iOS or Android",
    step2Title: 'Create Your Account',
    step2Desc: 'Register and set up your profile',
    step3Title: 'Connect Your Wallet',
    step3Desc: 'Link your crypto wallet for transactions',
    step4Title: 'Start Exploring',
    step4Desc: 'Discover content, follow creators and connect with di community',
    intro2: 'Dis app dey grow by dey use decentralize miner network, na dem dey share computer power for host, convert (transcode), and send content dat suppose live forever by design.',
    accountsDesc2: 'One person can use many different accounts from same browser. You manage dem in Settings → Profile: add account, switch between dem, and DeHub change all dem session — wallet, feed, messages and notifications — in one step. Add account no make you log out from account you dey use now, and if switch no complete, dem go back to where you dey before. How many account you can keep in list go increase with your staking badge.',
    uploadWatch2earn: 'Every token now fit wey you go get sustainable watch-to-earn benefit just by click button.',
    uploadNFT: 'Waist post as NFT, na di post carry lifetime royalty for di video. Minting no dey forsa—post go publish immediately on di chain, no wallet, no signature, and you go mint later from di post itself.',
    tocAllowance: 'Posting allowance',
    allowanceTitle: 'Daily posting allowance',
    allowanceIntro2: 'Text post and media dey separate pool. Run out one no go touch de oda, so one day spend upload video still leave all ten text post free. Both reset at midnight UTC.',
    allowanceHowDesc: 'Order dey important, and dey be deliberate too: you no pay for post dat no go publish, and you no go upload big file just for dem tell you later dat you no fit pay for it.',
    allowanceStep1: 'E app go check price against what you already post today and confirm your wallet fit for it. No charge, no upload until it pass.',
    allowanceStep2: 'Yousey post go live wey dem dey give for free. No payment, no wait, wey? Publishing no dey wait for money.',
    allowanceUnpaidTitle: 'If you decline',
    allowanceUnpaidDesc: 'Post stay dey publish for now. Any unpaid amount stay open against your account and block your next paid post until you settle it — but free post no go block. Any money dey come for tomorrow, you still get it, no matter if you still owe money or not.',
    allowanceCountsTitle: 'Wetin dey count against am',
    allowanceCounts2: 'Video, photo, and audio posts dey use up your data allowance — even dem small preview pictures (thumbnails), because dem dey store and send out too.',
    allowanceCounts3: 'Quote post count wey dey like dey own post, so if you quote post wey got video, na data go dey waste.',
    allowanceCounts5: 'Repost, comment, reaction, tip, message—all dem no cost na no go dey touch allowance.',
    tokenisedTitle: 'Tokenised Content & Fractionalised Ownership',
    tokenisedSubtitle: 'Revolutionary ERC-1155 Content Tokenisation',
    autoFractionalisation: 'Automatic Fractionalisation',
    autoFrac2: 'Automatically split into 1,000 fractions',
    eternalRev4: 'No need for any extra money-making now.',
    bettingDesc: 'DeHub wey create first platform for fans go invest money in creators dem believe dem go become big success. Na through buy fraction of content NFT, supporters dem go become part-owner of creator’s journey, earn money when dem creators dey make success through ad money, tips, and other ways dem dey make money.',
    fracStep1Desc: 'Choose make you mint, and di post go turn ERC-1155 NFT wey split into exact 1,000 tradeable fractions. Skip am and di post still go publish — you fit mint am later.',
    fracStep2Desc: 'Creators dey choose how many of dem 1,000 *fractions* (na dem call "fractions" for now) dey go sell, keep, or give to dem community.',
    fracStep3Desc: 'Supporters buy small shares, dey become owners, so dey get money from all money dey make, like dey dey share.',
    comparisonTitle: 'SocialFi Platform Comparison',
    comparisonDesc: 'Unlike other SocialFi platforms wey creators must keep add value for dem tokens, shares, or keys for dem to stay strong, DeHub content dey generate money for life. Once you create content, dem dey earn ad money forever - give you passive, no need permission, no one can censor, money for always, no need you keep work for it.',
