    useCase2: 'Diversify across multiple creators',
    profileDesc: 'Control wey people can see or no see for you, but you still fit export all your followers\' data any time. Na this wey, you dey own your channel fully, and you fit take your business anywhere you go, no matter what happen.',
    directTitle: 'Direct',
    dehubTokenTitle: 'DeHub Token',
    instantPayments: 'Instant Payments',
    secureGateway: 'Secure Gateway',
    importantNotice: 'Important Notice',
    tokenDisclaimer: 'DeHub tokens dey like utility tokens inside our system, like in-game money, no be for investment. Even though our blockchain system give us very clear and verifiable data for learning, all market carry risk. You might lose all your money because of market change, technical problem, hacking, or something unexpected. Only use money you can afford to lose fully. DeHub and its people no go take responsibility for any money you lose.',
    exploreFormula: 'Dem wey go determine share wey ad dey make money (RS) for you. Algorithm exact wey go dey for dis, still under beta, and go change depending wey money dey come (RG).',
    badgeDesc: 'DeHub token you dey, de more reward you dey get, no need for talk. Na like dis include but no limit to Badge of Honour system wey go open better cosmetics for your public profile, and also more premium, improved features.',
    badgeUnlockTitle: 'Na badje wey you dey unlock, na what kind of privilege, access, or reward wey come for you when you complete certain condition or task. Like, if you dey play game, badje wey you unlock, maybe give you special power, or make you look cool inside game. Or if you dey work, badje wey you unlock, maybe show your skill level, or make you get promotion.',
    badgeDelegationB1Desc: 'A Megalodon lend Megalodon. A badge dey show how much power you dey command, so people you support go carry same thing you carry.',
    badgeDelegationB3Desc: 'Hovah any delegashun badge anyweah in dis app, na person dey support im go tell you. No hide-hide wey tier come from.',
    badgeDelegationB4Desc: 'Take back your slot, and your tier come back to you. Your own stake, fee tier, and lock badge no change for any loan you give.',
    badgeDelegationB6Desc: 'A slot no dey force you drop your top tier. Pick the unlocked rung dem dey give you, and back somebody at King Cobra no make dem become Megalodon.',
    badgeDelegationB7Desc: 'Na badge dey show for account inside their notification bell, and dem can refuse it. Any of you can finish delegation after dat.',
    tipDesc1: 'Wetin we dey do for our integrated tip service for all uploads and live streams, only dey charge 10% fee, unlike TikTok and other big boys in industry who dey charge 60% na dem. Also, you go vote for video cancellation, so power stay in the hand of the viewer.',
    mineDesc1: 'Oga, only a few wallet dey hold more than 50 million DeHub token, na most of dem dey be operational wallet, while dem remaining ones be people wey wey know in community.',
    mineDynamic: 'DeHub token wey dey for all utility na number wey go change like, so any time price go change, dem go change am too. Any change wey dey go happen, we go announce am for all official channel.',
    quadraticVoting: 'Quadratic Voting',
    quadratic2: 'Example: Voting power = √(tokens staked)',
    quadratic3: 'Oga, stake 100 token = 10 vote, 10,000 token = 100 vote (no be 10,000 vote).',
    modStakingPools: 'Moderation Staking Pools',
    modStaking4: 'Correct vote (like final result) go get reward; wrong vote go get slash.',
    delegated2: 'Curator/moderator dey go change any time.',
    delegated3: 'Dis allow people who no dey do much (passive users) to join governance, but still, dem dey give reward to dem who dey do active work.',
    contentTiering: 'Content Tiering via Curation Markets',
    curation2: 'Market dey decide wey na rise (token-weighted attention), no algorithm.',
    curation3: 'If bad content dey get boost and flag, curator dey go chop chop.',
    daoAppeals: 'DAO-Based Appeals',
    dao1: 'Content creators wey dey make video, post, or write can go dey say no to any decision dat moderators make by make DAO proposal.',
    dao3: 'Help prevent abuse by moderation team or people coming together to attack one person.',
