    feedsMatureDesc: 'Creators mark post as "mature" while dey write it. Mature posts no dey show on public home feed and no dey come up in search, but dey still dey full visible on creator\'s profile and for people dey follow dem. Viewers dat wan see dem everywhere, dey go turn on "Show mature content" in settings.',
