    communitiesTitle: 'Communities & Events',
    communitiesDesc2: 'Efis event dey expand community wit time-bound activities. A community or platform can plan event, post a special event page wit all details, and let members follow live when it start. Together, community and event give ecosystem power to organise around common interest and keep people coming back.',
