    workDesc2: 'Bounty Hunting na dey grow whole ecosystem for wey na native. Creator dey use for drive engagement and build community dem by post bounty for share, clip, reaction or content dat go spread work dem. Project and DeHub community big big dey use for self-promote and grow ecosystem, reward hunter for task dat bring new people in. Same system dat settle contract, same system dat settle task for community engagement.',
