    workB3Desc: 'Bounties dey organize for Social Media, Clipping, and Contracts, so engagement work and long-term jobs dey have different sections for dem.',
    workB4Desc: 'Efari reward dey hold in escrow wey any hunter post bounty, na only after work dey accept wey dem go release for hunter, protect both side.',
    workB5Desc: 'Creators post bounties for grow their community, and DeHub community post bounties for self-promote and make the ecosystem big, make promotion one for get reward and trackable activity.',
