    feature4: 'Build decentralised guilds and e-sports divisions wit pro gamers wey dey already',
    intro1: 'As team wey full wit gamers & streamers, we build and release some fun, free arcade games and we dey work towards our first flagship game, Last Chad Standing, di first MMA Battle Royale ever, wit team of devs from places like Ubisoft plus founding team wey dey deep inside UFC, Oktagon and PFL stars matter, wey don film documentaries wit champs like Jorge Masvidal, and train under Conor Mcgregor Coach Kavannah. Na Luke Barnatt, di head of Andrew Tate War room and former UFC slugger, film di documentaries for DeHub behalf.',
    intro4: 'Ecosystem wey dey really improve imself and wey fit last.',
    lcsDesc: 'Battle royale wey dey hyper realistic and full of blood, wit top UFC stars, game developers from Ubisoft and top memes wit dem own skins.',
