    q3_2025_items: ['Release live stream keys make users fit stream for plenty apps at di same time ✅', 'Release fiat onramp with Stripe integration wey allow users wey dey use 130+ currencies buy DeHub tokens easy-easy inside di app and use am sharp-sharp with free gas ✅', 'Start Solana, Hyperliquid and Sui integrations to use inside di app ✅'],
    q3_2026_items: ['Di web repository don go public under MIT licence — every line of di app dey ship for open ✅', 'Stages don grow from live audio room turn full broadcast stack: scheduling, reminders, short invite links, go-live from browser without OBS, screen share, audience chat and live crowd even before di doors open ✅', 'Live subtitles for stages, wey dem translate enter any language wey people for di room dey read, plus live dubbing with di host own cloned voice, wey you go pay per minute with DeHub tokens ✅', 'Every stage dey record, with playback wey you fit jump forward and back, and corner player wey web and mobile share ✅', '@assistant don go live for posts, comments, live chat and direct messages with real tools instead of keyword matching, e dey open support tickets wey go reach real human, and e dey build apps wey you describe give am ✅', 'Creator Studio v2: native generation studio with Canva-style editor, multi-track video editor, render queue wey everybody share, ElevenLabs audio, 3D model generation, free asset library, di Creator Flow canvas and sixteen presets ✅', 'You dey pay for AI generation with DeHub tokens, at price wey dem go tell you before each job, plus five free starter images for every wallet ✅', 'Di feed dey translate itself enter your language without say you need wallet, and you fit dub any video enter your language for your own device free ✅', 'Brand poster and banner rendering don dey free and e dey give di same result every time for SM Template 2.0 renderer, and dem don re-render every blog banner and share card for di new style ✅', 'Six new appearance themes — War, Osaka, Jungle, Island, Hacker and Horror — wey make di platform get fourteen full skins ✅', 'Di arcade don open with six games: King\'s Gambit chess, Jungle Trail, Street Slayer, Claude of Duty, di God\'s Eye community globe and Chartopia — trading floor wey you fit waka inside, wey still dey run for VR headset — and e don start to collect submissions from other developers wey dem go review ✅', 'Sign in with Google, Apple, Telegram, code wey dem send to your email, SMS code, passkey or wallet, run plenty identities from one browser, and delete your account by yourself from Settings ✅', 'Di badge ladder price dey for dollars, no be token count, price no fit ever collect back tier wey you don earn, and you fit lend badge give another account — one slot for every step wey you climb ✅', 'Badge now dey add weight to wetin you do: view or reaction go count pass as your tier dey high, for di same ladder as governance voting ✅', 'All twelve SuperPowers don go live, and Team up dey allow reach eight accounts join dia wallet power together ✅', 'Creators dey mark post as mature while dem dey write am, and viewers go choose whether dem wan see am, so adult and graphic work fit stay for DeHub without say e reach home feed ✅', 'Kids Mode: mode wey PIN dey protect, wey dey show only posts wey dem make for children ✅', 'Ten reactions with double-tap and triple-tap, pinned comments and di ones wey collect di highest tip dey show first, Common Ground mode and AI tone assistant inside di comment box ✅', 'Direct messages don get end-to-end encryption, with editing, replies, reactions, suggested replies, docked chats and full-screen calls ✅', 'Dem don rebuild live streaming on top DeHub own ingest with playback wey near real-time, screen sharing, camera looks, permanent stream key, chat for every stream, gift animations wey get levels, and replays ✅', 'Multi-posting: publish go X, Instagram, YouTube, TikTok, Farcaster and eight other platforms from di DeHub composer ✅', 'Articles: long-form mode inside di composer with formatting, cover image and drafts ✅', 'Di DeHub exchange: order book, buy and sell sharp-sharp, Easy trade from di wallet, and community pools for any token for Base, Ethereum, Robinhood Chain or Solana ✅', 'Marketplaces for username, account and fraction ✅', 'Di mini app store with SDK and Sign in with DeHub, so anybody fit build apps wey dey run inside DeHub ✅', 'Custom emoji, sticker and GIF packs wey badge holders make, plus full emoji picker ✅', 'Di DAO treasury page and DAO proposals, plus governance votes wey dem dey check for server with seven-day window and ten-wallet quorum ✅', 'Di wallet don reach Solana, Robinhood Chain and Arc, you fit send tips and payments with almost any token, and buying don move go DeHub Pay with card or crypto from $0.50 ✅', 'Di Converter dey carry content come from twenty-one sources, whole channels at once, and podcasts through RSS feed ✅', 'Cinema: find where you fit watch any film or series ✅', 'DePIN backup node tier wey dey run for browser ✅', 'New members don turn full directory with chip wey dey follow di name everywhere and guided walkthrough wey you fit choose, and moderation don move enter admin panel with chat powers and report log ✅', 'Dem rebuild wallets and sign-in from beginning to end, and minting no dey compulsory again — publish off-chain without any wallet at all and mint later if you want ✅', 'Mobile don catch up for feeds, stages, posting, messaging and notifications ✅', 'Daily posting allowance, and anything wey pass am go cost DeHub tokens: ten text posts and one gigabyte free every day, e dey increase with your staking badge reach 100 posts and 10 GB ✅'],
    q4_2021_items: ['Release prediction and raffle games', 'List for Gate.io after price jump almost 1000x, with near $10m inside our LP', 'We find out sey di listing agent na fraudster: e thief di money wey we raise and dump our chart instead of to airdrop Gate users. Gate investigate and beg, but dem no fit find di bad staff because dem lose di records, as dem talk.', 'Put game mechanics wey get randomisation wey you fit prove sey e fair', 'Community grow reach 8,000+ active members'],
    q4_2022_items: ['Di contract tax triggers spoil, dem freeze di token and our LP, so we gats relaunch as v2', 'Move 25,000+ token holders go new contract wey better pass', 'Put standard ERC20 tokenomics make future wahala no happen'],
    q4_2023_items: ['We comot from Gate.io by ourself to put decentralisation first', 'We commit to transparency as we dey implement all DEX policy', 'Put automatic strategies to provide liquidity', 'Publish full transparency reports wey show all di protocol metrics'],
    q4_2024_items: ['Release onchain subscriptions wey you fit trade', 'Release teaser for Last Chad Standing (di first MMA battle royale ever) wey get 1M+ views', 'Di agency grow reach UK #1 with 1,000 live streamers wey sign only with us', 'DePIN Phase 1 don comot', 'Private chat features wey get end-to-end encryption ✅'],
