    profitShareTitle: 'Profit share',
    disclaimer: 'Disclaimer',
    disclaimerNoApy: 'Waight, for dem people dey hold DeHub token, dem na real owner of DeHub network, and dem dey get share of protocol profit for dey stake. But no dey have fixed APY, no guarantee for any rate of return, and no say dem go make money for sure. All dem reward dey depend on how network dey perform and how much money protocol dey make in dat period. Reward might be lower than before, or even zero. Na no way dis page go promise, say how much money you go get, or give financial advice.',
